"submitter.efs" generated: JET compiler internal file
"submitter.rfs" generated: JET compiler control file
"submitter.rsp" JET configuration file
"submitter.usg" generated: JET compiler method use tracking
"submitter-setup.exe" JET distributable, containing runtime
"submitter.ico" Windows icon for the project, contains multiple image sizes
"submitter.jpn" Manifest of what is included in the JET executable.
"submitter.log" log of what JET did compiling and preparing the distributable
"submitter.prj" JET project configuration, compiler options and notes on what needs to be included.
"submitter.startup" List of classes JET should preload for speed.
"submitter.xbind.script" List of DLLs JET will need to run the app.
"build_submitter.bat" Build JET executable with project descriptor
"run_submitter.bat" Runs the JET executable with default parm.
"mindprod.css" cascading style sheet for general HTML
"jdisplay.css" cascading style sheet for displaying source code in HTML
"package-info.java" Dummy Java source with JavaDoc describing the entire package.
"untouch.digest" generated: enables untouching (set date back) unchanged but redated files.
"mindprodcert2017rsa.cer" Public key for Mindprod code-signing certificate. Cannot be used to sign jars.
"DESCRIPT.ION" TCC file descriptions
"descript0.ion" generated file of overriding descriptions to merge into DESCRIPT.ION
"descript2.ion" generated file default descriptions to merge into DESCRIPT.ION
"MasterDistribution.site" URL to find the master copy of the Submitter project files
"submitter.use" precis(summary) Submits PAD XMLs to 66 PADsites Generated
"submitter.vpj" Slick Edit project ini file
"submitter.vpw" Slick Edit project ini file
"submitter.vtg" Slick Edit binary tag xref file
"submitter.icon16.png" 16x16 icon for the Submitter project
"submitter.icon32.png" 32x32 icon for the Submitter project
"submitter.icon48.png" roughly 48x48 icon for the Submitter project
"submitter.icon64.png" roughly 64x64 icon for the Submitter project
"submitter.icon128.png" roughly 128x128 icon for the Submitter project
"submitter.screenshot.png" screenshot for the Submitter project
"submitter.splash.gif" splash gif for the Submitter project
"submitter.icon32.gif" 32x32 gif icon for the Submitter project
"submitter.icon64.gif" 64x64 gif icon for the Submitter project
